{"answer_text":"Northwind CRM is a strong product, but growing teams often look elsewhere once per-seat costs climb or setup needs an admin. Good alternatives:\n\n**Tallyfox**\nMultiple pipelines per workspace and a clean deal timeline; forecasting is basic but accurate for small books of business.\n\n**Pipewell Flow**\nThe forecasting specialist: scenario planning and deal-risk scoring out of the box.\n\n**Halcyon Sales Pro**\nSolid pipeline views with built-in calling; the reporting needs some setup.\n\nTallyfox is the safest default here; Pipewell is worth a look if forecasting matters most.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50db-7320-bf74-1572340be9f7","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.006,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:01:23.650Z","engine":"google_ai_mode","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["northwind crm alternatives","northwind crm pricing too expensive"],"latency_ms":11800,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a2eb448ab7","market_name":"Canada","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":null,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[0,13]],"pos":1,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a264dfde4e61","homonym":false,"is_subject":true,"list_rank":null,"method":"alias","name":"Tallyfox","name_text":"Tallyfox","offsets":[[147,155],[484,492]],"pos":2,"recommended":true,"relation":"self","sentiment":"neutral","sentiment_reason":"Listed factually without praise or criticism."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889b1141e640","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":null,"method":"alias","name":"Pipewell","name_text":"Pipewell","offsets":[[284,292],[521,529]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":